OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying windy, with a mixture
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and variable amounts
OL,7,Fof cloud. The occasional shower is
OL,8,Flikely, heavy at times, although some
OL,9,Fparts could stay dry. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear normal, or just above, for late
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells and showers
OL,14,Fthrough the evening. Cloud then
OL,15,Fthickens after midnight, with further
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain likely, perhaps
OL,17,Fturning persistent in the west. Winds
OL,18,Feasing slightly, but staying breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
