OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOutbreaks of rain at first,
OL,6,Fhowever these gradually fading through
OL,7,Fthe morning with most places dry by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Some sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping, with winds also easing
OL,10,Ffurther. Rather mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FVariable cloud and sunny spells, and
OL,14,Ftemperatures near normal. However, any
OL,15,Fovernight mist and fog patches could
OL,16,Fbe slow to clear. Winds becoming light
OL,17,Fand variable. Perhaps some rain
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
